{"id": "EUVD-2026-98065", "enisaUuid": "72d22a74-d27b-3012-9dda-a9b469220ca5", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.98.0 and 16.x before 16.6.0 contains an SQL injection vulnerability in some endpoints caused by missing input validation. Remote authenticated attackers can send specially crafted requests to the affected endpoints to manipulate database queries and extract sensitive information from the database.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:42:34", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-wj7p-g62h-jh38", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-16.6.0-sql-injection-via-missing-input-validation"], "aliases": ["GHSA-gqg9-2w62-58r8", "CVE-2026-109674"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "74be1cd5-622e-3cef-9a3d-8f620d6e03c7", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.6.0"}, {"id": "b6ec7b0f-8347-3085-b9aa-e03f8f169bf0", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.98.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "72d09bdf-0c1f-3b06-83d3-d5911d9c435b", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}